{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/elmorshedy-del/MorshLive/pull/27","repo":"elmorshedy-del/MorshLive","number":27,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Fix fullscreen + strip remaining player popups (Senegal/vip2)","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Problem\nSenegal vs Iraq (beIN MAX 1 → vip2) still showed a popup and fullscreen did not work.\n\n## Root cause\n- Worldkoora vip pages now use **Clappr** directly (not yalla3arab iframe). Stale `/wk/` cache could still serve old Yalla Score HTML.\n- Player chrome (`aplr-menu`, ConsoleBan scripts) cluttered the embed.\n- Nested embed fullscreen is unreliable on mobile — no site-level fullscreen control.\n\n## Fix\n- **worker.js**: remove Yalla Score block entirely, strip ConsoleBan/ad scripts, hide worldkoora menu, inject CSS so Clappr fills the frame, `Cache-Control: no-store`\n- **watch page**: fullscreen button on player shell (both Player 1 embed + Player 2 VIP)\n- **CSS**: fullscreen styles for `.player-shell`\n\n## Test\n- [ ] Senegal match loads without Yalla Score / menu overlay\n- [ ] Fullscreen button expands player on mobile + desktop\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-619d1ce8-941f-4449-82d4-7d7c4a0d5da7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-619d1ce8-941f-4449-82d4-7d7c4a0d5da7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" heig